Notes on the data:
  - All user identifiers are hashed; no personally identifying information
    (names, phone numbers, email addresses, profile photos) is present.
  - Dates are preserved at day-level granularity.
  - The `creators_phase1.csv` (non-anonymized) file is included only as an
    internal cross-validation aid; the corresponding `_anon` version is the
    canonical public release.
  - This is preliminary data from a manuscript in preparation. Future revisions
    may include additional Phase 2 / Phase 3 data; the dataset versioning
    follows semantic versioning (current version 0.1).
